---

<StoreLayout title="The Science & Sourcing Dossier | Sujata Nutrilive">

  {/* UNIFIED LUXURY STORE HEADER */}
  <StoreHeader />

  <main class="bg-[#FAF9F6] min-h-screen pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-20 selection:bg-[#166534] selection:text-white">
    
    {/* =========================================================================
        ZONE 1: HERO - ARCHITECTURE OF MOLECULAR PURITY
        ========================================================================= */}
    <section class="relative max-w-[85rem] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 mb-20 md:mb-28">
      
      {/* Breadcrumb Navigation */}
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-gray-400 hover:text-[#166534] transition-colors py-2 touch-manipulation flex items-center gap-1.5 group">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 12H5m7-7-7 7 7 7"/></svg>
          <span>Store</span>
        </a>
        <span class="w-6 h-[1px] bg-gray-300"></span>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[#166534]">The Science & Sourcing Dossier</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#064E3B] via-[#043427] to-[#022219] rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-14 lg:p-20 text-white overflow-hidden shadow-[0_30px_70px_rgba(2,44,34,0.35)] border border-emerald-500/20">
        
        {/* Ambient Glowing Orbs */}
        <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-400/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-400/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center relative z-10">
          
          <div class="lg:col-span-7">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/30 mb-6 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
              <span class="text-emerald-300 text-[10px] md:text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">
                Clinical Transparency Protocol
              </span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-6">
              BEYOND RAW.<br/>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 italic">BEYOND ORGANIC.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="text-emerald-100/80 text-sm md:text-base font-light leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl">
              We stripped away marketing buzzwords. Here is the uncompromised cellular science behind Sujata's <strong>Sub-40°C Cold Extraction</strong>, zero-binder molecular integrity, and third-party certified NABL purity.
            </p>

            {/* 4 Pillars Odometer Metrics Bar */}
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6 pt-8 border-t border-emerald-800/60">
              
              <div class="flex flex-col">
                <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-amber-400 mb-1">
                  0.00%
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-emerald-200/70">Heavy Metals</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-col">
                <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-emerald-300 mb-1">
                  &lt; 40°C
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-emerald-200/70">Cold Extract</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-col">
                <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-white mb-1">
                  98.4%
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-emerald-200/70">Absorption</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-col">
                <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-amber-400 mb-1">
                  420+
                </span>
                <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-emerald-200/70">Clinical Trials</span>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Right Visual Card with Real High-Res Photography */}
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
            <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-emerald-500/30 shadow-2xl bg-black/30 aspect-[4/5] group">
              <img 
                src="/sujata_harvest_bioreactor.png" 
                alt="Sujata Closed Bioreactor Facility" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" 
              />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                  <span>Pure Sunlight Hydro-Dome</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-300 font-light">Enclosed high-altitude cultivation using mountain aquifer water. Zero environmental pollutants.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    {/* =========================================================================
        INFOGRAPHIC SECTION 1: VISUAL SOURCING COMPARISON (BIOREACTOR VS OPEN POND)
        ========================================================================= */}
    <section class="max-w-[85rem] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 mb-24 md:mb-32">
      
      <div class="mb-14 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <span class="text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] block mb-2">Visual Sourcing Audit</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-[#111827] leading-[1.15] mb-4">
          Where Does Your Spirulina Grow?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs md:text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
          The environment where microalgae is cultivated dictates 90% of its clinical purity. Open ponds absorb toxic contaminants from the surrounding air and soil.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Side-by-Side Visual Infographic Grid */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        {/* Card 1: Sujata Closed Bioreactor */}
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-950/5 to-[#F0FDF4] border-2 border-emerald-600/30 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <span class="bg-[#166534] text-white text-[10px] font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm">
                ✨ Sujata Gold Standard
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-800">100% Contaminant-Free</span>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-emerald-500/20 mb-6 relative">
              <img src="/sujata_harvest_bioreactor.png" alt="Sujata Clean Bioreactor" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
              <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[10px] text-white font-mono">
                Location: Closed Alkaline Dome
              </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-[#111827] mb-4">
              Enclosed Sunlight Hydro-Dome
            </h3>

            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Pure Mountain Aquifer Water:</strong> Alkaline mineral water sourced from deep underground springs.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Zero Aerial Contamination:</strong> Shielded from bird droppings, acid rain, and highway smog.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Zero Pesticide Runoff:</strong> No agricultural chemical seepage from adjacent farm lands.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-emerald-900/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-emerald-900">
            <span>Heavy Metal Level: <strong>0.00%</strong></span>
            <span>Microbial Status: <strong>Sterile</strong></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Card 2: Commercial Open Ponds */}
        <div class="bg-gray-50/80 border-2 border-red-200 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
              <span class="bg-red-600 text-white text-[10px] font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm">
                ❌ Commercial Mass Brands
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-red-700">High Contamination Risk</span>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-red-200 mb-6 relative bg-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center">
              <img src="/natural_water_leaves_backdrop.png" alt="Open Pond Agriculture" class="w-full h-full object-cover filter grayscale contrast-125 opacity-70" />
              <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-red-950/70 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[10px] text-white font-mono">
                Location: Open Farm Ponds
              </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-gray-800 mb-4">
              Open Industrial Earth Ponds
            </h3>

            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">✕</span>
                <span><strong>Stagnant Surface Water:</strong> Open to environmental rainfall, dust storms, and airborne pollution.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">✕</span>
                <span><strong>Bird & Wildlife Contact:</strong> Fecal matter in open water breeds toxic microcystins & coliforms.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">✕</span>
                <span><strong>Industrial Groundwater:</strong> High risk of groundwater heavy metals (Lead, Mercury, Arsenic).</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-red-900">
            <span>Heavy Metal Level: <strong>Variable / High</strong></span>
            <span>Microbial Status: <strong>Requires Irradiation</strong></span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    {/* =========================================================================
        INFOGRAPHIC SECTION 2: THERMAL THRESHOLD & BIO-ENZYME CHART
        ========================================================================= */}
    <section class="max-w-[85rem] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 mb-24 md:mb-32">
      
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#064E3B] to-[#022219] text-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-14 lg:p-16 border border-emerald-500/20 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        
        {/* Glows */}
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-emerald-400/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12 relative z-10">
          <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] block mb-2">Molecular Integrity Infographic</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-white leading-tight mb-4">
            The Thermal Threshold Curve.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-emerald-100/80 text-xs sm:text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Phycocyanin and active enzymes in Spirulina are heat-labile. When temperatures exceed 45°C, their therapeutic molecular structure permanently collapses.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Visual Temperature Gradient Chart */}
        <div class="relative z-10 bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 mb-8 backdrop-blur-md">
          
          {/* Temperature Spectrum Bar */}
          <div class="w-full h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 via-amber-500 to-red-600 mb-8 relative shadow-inner flex items-center justify-between px-3">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-black">25°C (Ambient)</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-black hidden sm:inline">45°C (Enzyme Death)</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black text-white">180°C (Flash Burn)</span>
          </div>

          {/* 3 Callout Cards on the Spectrum */}
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            
            {/* Zone 1: Sub-40C Sujata */}
            <div class="bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-400/40 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-300">ZONE 01: SUJATA</span>
                  <span class="text-base font-black text-emerald-400">&lt; 40°C</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">Cryo-Dehydration Window</h4>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-emerald-100/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
                  Gentle low-temperature air extraction locks in <strong>100% active Phycocyanin</strong>, living chlorophyll, and intact cellular membranes.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-800/40 text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>🌟 100% Therapeutic Potency</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Zone 2: The Critical Barrier */}
            <div class="bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-300">ZONE 02: CRITICAL</span>
                  <span class="text-base font-black text-amber-400">45°C</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">Enzymatic Death Point</h4>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-100/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
                  Heat breaks the delicate protein bonds of Superoxide Dismutase (SOD) and Phycocyanin. Potency drops by <strong>over 80%</strong>.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-amber-800/40 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>⚠️ Permanent Molecular Degradation</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Zone 3: Commercial Spray Drying */}
            <div class="bg-red-950/40 border border-red-500/30 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-red-300">ZONE 03: COMMERCIAL</span>
                  <span class="text-base font-black text-red-400">180°C</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-2">Industrial Spray Drying</h4>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-red-100/70 leading-relaxed font-light">
                  Algae slurry is blasted through 180°C hot air furnaces to dry in seconds. Active enzymes are charred into dead, inactive powder.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-red-800/40 text-[10px] font-bold text-red-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>❌ Zero Live Enzyme Potency</span>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    {/* =========================================================================
        INFOGRAPHIC SECTION 3: 4-STEP MOLECULAR EXTRACTION FLOWCHART
        ========================================================================= */}
    <section class="max-w-[85rem] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 mb-24 md:mb-32">
      
      <div class="mb-14 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <span class="text-emerald-800 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] block mb-2">Process Engineering</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-['Playfair_Display'] font-black text-[#111827] leading-[1.15] mb-4">
          The 4-Step Cold-Press Protocol.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs md:text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
          From mountain aquifer harvest to NABL double-assay verification, every batch follows a strict 72-hour purity protocol.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
